  :changes "The code of the page's Implementation section (HTML tags removed, entities decoded), in an R6RS library exporting the names the SRFI lists. Changes: the SRFI-9 define-record-type becomes R6RS's (fields), same accessor names; ERROR wraps R6RS's (who #f); MODULO (not in R6RS) is defined by mod with an exact result (the reference's hash of an inexact number was a flonum, no vector index; infinities and NaN hash to 0); (rnrs)'s string-hash, string-ci-hash and symbol-hash are excluded from the import, the library's own exported; set-cdr! from (rnrs mutable-pairs). The reference's extras (make-symbol-hash-table, make-string-hash-table, make-string-ci-hash-table, make-integer-hash-table, symbol-hash, the % helpers) are not exported. The tests (test/scheme/srfi/srfi-69.sps) are written for the port."}]
